      "interpretation": "Equilibrium batch isotherm tests quantified PFAS uptake by GAC as a function of equilibrium PFAS concentration, to derive adsorption capacities and isotherm parameters and to assess how source water characteristics (NOM, competing PFAS, ions, pH) affect capacity. These measurements address sorption behavior rather than column breakthrough or destruction.",
