      "interpretation": "The study evaluates the suitability and limitations of applying ideal adsorbed solution theory (IAST) and AdDesignS-type models for predicting PFAS mixture adsorption from batch isotherm data, highlighting that PFAS trace-level behavior and competition can lead to modeling inaccuracies when scaling to column performance.",
      "reported_term": "modeling performance of IAST and column-scale design assumptions"
    }
