        "S03-E04",
        "S03-E07"
      ],
      "statement": "Because the work uses controlled batch isotherm experiments rather than site-specific pilot or full-scale columns, results can indicate general trends but cannot replace site-specific pilot or other studies to determine actual GAC breakthrough performance."
